OL,3,GNEWSAFormer permanent secretary alleges
OL,4,Ahe was 'bullied' by education minister,
OL,5,Asays MLA
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former permanent secretary at the
OL,8,FDepartment of Education (DE) alleged he
OL,9,Fwas "bullied" by the education
OL,10,Fminister, a Sinn Fein assembly member
OL,11,F(MLA) has said.
OL,13,FThe vice-chair of Stormont's education
OL,14,Fcommittee, Pat Sheehan, made the claim
OL,15,Fduring a committee hearing on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
