OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer permanent secretary alleges
OL,4,Ahe was 'bullied' by education minister,
OL,5,Asays MLA
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Everyone knows the accusation was from
OL,8,Fthe permanent secretary at the time,
OL,9,FMark Browne, who alleged that the
OL,10,Fminister had bullied him or pressurised
OL,11,Fhim into trying to promote another
OL,12,Fofficial within the department,"
OL,13,FSheehan said.
OL,15,FIn a statement to the assembly in March
OL,16,F2026, Paul Givan had clarified that
OL,17,Fallegations of "bullying" had been made
OL,18,Fagainst him by an unnamed civil
OL,19,Fservant.
